{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short horror game where you try to escape from a bathroom using a point-and-click interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strange phenomena in a restroom that should be empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A teacher who never comes out from the neighboring stall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items that shouldn\u2019t be there appear in the restroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo allows you to play with some choices locked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the terrifying experience of facing eerie situations in a bathroom with no way out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo play time: 20 to 30 minutes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game progresses mainly through movies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ability to return to branching scenes from the scenario chart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[/list]</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3208220?t=1749220689","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3208220?t=1749220689","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208220/131dc7c2d9702929e30ee1abcdf811ed7b06ecf5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749220689","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208220/131dc7c2d9702929e30ee1abcdf811ed7b06ecf5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749220689","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Includes horror elements such as bloodshed."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short horror game where you try to escape from a bathroom using a point-and-click interface.</p